5 bo‘lsa, `=MAX(A2,B2)*2` formula natijasi qancha?","correct":0,"options":["24","17","10","7"],"cognitive":"qollash","construct":"S2.OFFICE.02","difficulty":3},{"exp":"45 >= 50 sharti yolg‘on, shuning uchun ikkinchi matn qaytariladi.","ref":"reserve-2026:T060-R1-OFF-Q10","stem":"M2=45 bo‘lsa, `=IF(M2>=50,\"O‘tdi\",\"Yiqildi\")` natijasi qaysi?","correct":0,"options":["Yiqildi","O‘tdi","45","FALSE"],"cognitive":"qollash","construct":"S2.OFFICE.02","difficulty":3},{"exp":"MIN=3, MAX=11; yig‘indi 14.","ref":"reserve-2026:T060-R1-OFF-Q11","stem":"A1=8, A2=3, A3=11 bo‘lsa, `=MIN(A1:A3)+MAX(A1:A3)` natija qancha?","correct":0,"options":["14","11","8","22"],"cognitive":"qollash","construct":"S2.OFFICE.02","difficulty":3},{"exp":"A→Z tartibga keltirish o‘sish bo‘yicha saralashdir.","ref":"reserve-2026:T060-R1-OFF-Q12","stem":"Jadvalni Familiya bo‘yicha A dan Z gacha tartibga keltirish kerak. Qaysi amal bajariladi?","correct":0,"options":["Ascending Sort","Filter","Freeze Panes","Merge Cells"],"cognitive":"qollash","construct":"S2.OFFICE.03","difficulty":3},{"exp":"Filter shartga mos yozuvlarni ko‘rsatib, qolganlarini vaqtincha yashiradi.","ref":"reserve-2026:T060-R1-OFF-Q13","stem":"Sotuv jadvalida faqat `Hudud=Navoiy` bo‘lgan satrlarni vaqtincha ko‘rsatish kerak. Qaysi amal mos?","correct":0,"options":["Filter","Sort","Wrap Text","Conditional Formatting"],"cognitive":"qollash","construct":"S2.OFFICE.03","difficulty":3},{"exp":"Kategoriyalar qiymatini taqqoslashda ustunli diagramma qulay.","ref":"reserve-2026:T060-R1-OFF-Q14","stem":"To‘rtta sinfning o‘rtacha ballarini bir-biri bilan solishtirish uchun qaysi diagramma turi qulay?","correct":0,"options":["Ustunli (column/bar) diagramma","Doiraviy diagramma","Scatter faqat koordinatasiz","Hech qanday diagramma emas"],"cognitive":"qollash","construct":"S2.OFFICE.03","difficulty":3},{"exp":"Butunning ulushlarini ko‘rsatishda doiraviy diagramma mos keladi.","ref":"reserve-2026:T060-R1-OFF-Q15","stem":"Umumiy budjetning 40%, 30%,